    kg:text """Our illustrations are designed to work across different formats and communication needs - so we can use it in both full bleed and framed.

The usage of scene illustrations without background is not allowed.

Extend the background

<!-- image -->

<!-- image -->

Scaleandplacetheillustration You can scale the illustration and extend the background color to incorporate additional elements. You can insert text in this additional section, too. Adding additional elements Full bleed to framed trimmed on one or more sides while aligning with the format's edges.If framed, A Scene illustration can be used in full bleed for flexibility in the layout, or make sure the illustration is clear.

<!-- image -->

<!-- image -->

<!-- image -->""" ;
