    kg:text """Each Scene illustration must be prepared in the specified formats.

| File type    | Color mode    | File format   | Resolution     | Color versions: background                                                |
|--------------|---------------|---------------|----------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| Screen files | RGB           | SVG, PNG      | 1920 x 1920 px | Depending on the layout: Warm gray, secondary colors from light to medium |
| Print files  | CMYK, Pantone | EPS           |                | shades (Yellow, Blue, Red and Violet)                                     |

Accent Green is used as a Pantone color in the print version.""" ;
