    kg:text """Overall, our goal is to accurately document people's lives, without adhering to conventional beauty or social standards/stereotypes. Our primary aim is to capture humanity in all its unique variations without making those differences the central focal point of our imagery. We make sure to represent people in a safe and real environment. We use the correct equipment, and display safe behaviours.

