    kg:source_hash "cb54b9659f2b9171c314920a5bc5c37af6c81f2379a11133de2f4da2bb3bdc82" ;
    kg:text """Ourillustrationstyleisguided by ourbrand core:Unwaveringoptimism'Through simplelines and shapes, weconvey themeslikecollaboration,resilience,andinnovation.Italsohelpsusshowtheexpressionof love andaffectionbetweenhumansandanimals.

Weillustratewithasenseofpositivityacrossawiderangeofsubjects,frommedical toinnovation to lifestyle.Oneway wedo thisisbyusingwarmcolorpalettesand ahandmadelookand feel.""" ;
