    kg:source_document_type "guidance_document" ;
    kg:source_file_name "Imagery Production.pdf" ;
    kg:text """<!-- image -->

Finding the right stock image can bea time-consuming and challenging task. Beyond ensuring that the image aligns with brand guidelines,it'salsoessentialthat the content fits and the quality is high.But how do we find stock photos that truly meet these criteria?

Pleasesee themanualon the Resources &amp; Downloads page to assist your stock image search.

As a Boehringer employee, you can request access to Adobe Stock in MyServices - Service Now. ① Please visit INSITE and search for /lmagepool, here you will find the Guidelines for using Adobe Stock

- assetspurchasedbyBoehringer.""" .

