    kg:section_id "457d8bc2-64e8-4fb7-8097-2330bb2c7a89" ;
    kg:section_title "Mouthforhumans" ;
    kg:section_type "heading" ;
    kg:source_document_id "ab59869e-f86f-48d4-8916-fb89334732d4" ;
    kg:source_document_type "guidance_document" ;
    kg:source_file_name "BI Illustrations 4.pdf" ;
    kg:text """The mouth, like the eyes, is fundamental for conveying emotions and feelings. We use a simplified representation of lips for both menandwomen.

Openmouth When we illustrate people talking or smiling,or we want to share a more detailed ofthemouthisblack. age,gender andethnicity. Closedmouth Don't illustrate lips more than this with facial hair-this helps to ensure there aren'ttoomanyelementsintheillustration. Mouthwithbeard When someone is fully smiling we illustrate the internal part of the mouth in white, depicting the teeth without adding too many details. Openmouth-fullteeth Mouthwithmoustache background color.""" .

