    kg:text """<!-- image -->

When showing guest speakers like interview partners or other personalities, we recommend using natural, neutral backgroundswith awarm tone andsoft depth. Settings should feel calm and unobtrusive, avoiding any visual distraction.

Flatsurfaceslikeplainwallscanalsobesuitable whenchosen withcare.Avoid overly stylized or artificial cutouts. Images with harsh outlines or unrealistic shadows can appear poorly retouched and inauthentic.Pleasemaintainasenseofrealismand quality.

