    kg:page_number 27 ;
    kg:section_id "b9ab6e75-fffd-4933-9136-ab29de4c5b5b" ;
    kg:section_title "Magnifier" ;
    kg:section_type "heading" ;
    kg:source_document_id "ab59869e-f86f-48d4-8916-fb89334732d4" ;
    kg:source_document_type "guidance_document" ;
    kg:source_file_name "BI Illustrations 4.pdf" ;
    kg:text """In Technical illustrations, we use magnifiers to offer a closer, more detailed view of the illustration. This helps the audience understand the mechanical aspects and intricacies of the medical subject being depicted.

Magnifiers come in both round and rectangularshapes.

processes,enabling the inclusion of additional text as required. Rectangularmagnifier

Roundmagnifier Idealfora close-upview of theillustration,offering aclearer descriptionof the mechanics of the medical topic.""" .

<urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:section:ba1d129d-c967-4f06-b01d-3a7257261e56> a kg:Section ;
    rdfs:label "Imagery Production.pdf" ;
    kg:SECTION_HAS_CHUNK <urn:kg:boehringer-ingelheim:chunk:ce968eac-277b-436f-bc38-a5c744a5b1b2> ;
    kg:extraction_method "docling" ;
    kg:graphScope "brand" ;
    kg:page_number 2 ;
    kg:section_id "ba1d129d-c967-4f06-b01d-3a7257261e56" ;
    kg:section_title "People in our images" ;
    kg:section_type "heading" ;
    kg:source_document_id "0f55abc8-b39d-49f3-a7b4-22747fd324cd" ;
    kg:source_document_type "guidance_document" ;
    kg:source_file_name "Imagery Production.pdf" ;
    kg:text """Overall, our goal is to accurately document people's lives, without adhering to conventional beauty or social standards/stereotypes. Our primary aim is to capture humanity in all its unique variations without making those differences the central focal point of our imagery. We make sure to represent people in a safe and real environment. We use the correct equipment, and display safe behaviours.

<!-- image -->""" .

