    kg:text """When decidingwhether touseanillustration oranicon,remember:weuseillustrationsto conveyvarying degreesofdepth and complexity,evoking amoreemotionalresponse,andadding a storytellingelementto ourdesignandcontent. Weuseiconstosharesimpleinformationandprovideguidanceandnavigation-all throughasingle identifiablegraphic.

