    kg:source_document_type "brand_book" ;
    kg:source_file_name "BI Design Style Guide 1.pdf" ;
    kg:text """Tomaintaina consistentvisualstyleand levelofdetailinourillustrations,weexcludethefullbodyofpeople orlargeranimals. Thisguideline appliestoanimalssuchascows,horses,and otherspeciessurpassing specificsizeorweight threshold,typicallymeasuring over7o cminheightattheshoulder. Humansare alwaysportraitstylewiththefaceonly.

<!-- image -->""" .

